            "prologue": "Hello! I am your CRM Sales & Business Intelligence Assistant. I can analyze deals and leads across your CRM systems (Bitrix24, amoCRM, Kommo, HubSpot, 1C), register new incoming leads, verify warehouse stock, and search your corporate sales knowledge base. How can I help you today?"
